<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Inland rain expected in Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Inland rain expected in Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Friday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Canyon		   21.0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     1.8</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   1.0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0.7</p>
<p>    Moussakele		9.6</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	   56.0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  3.4</p>
<p>The department forecasts thundershowers will develop inland during the afternoon or evening and spread to western coastal areas later.</p>
</text>
